   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-wan22-i2v, with only the changes needed for this test. Load LoRA (DGX Monarch) connects the model loader to the sampler. Replace test_lora_placeholder.safetensors with your LoRA file; the placeholder strength is 0.8. The mixture of experts takes two: one on the high-noise model and one on the low-noise model."
   ],
